Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: grep command not found

Solution: Install grep: sudo apt install grep
Issue: Permission denied when running scripts

Solution: Make scripts executable: chmod +x script_name.sh
Issue: Cannot find log file

Solution: Ensure you're in the correct directory: cd ~/log-analysis-lab
Issue: Script shows no output

Solution: Verify log file exists: ls -l application.log
