Key Takeaways:

Log files provide critical insights into application health and performance
Different severity levels help prioritize issues (ERROR > WARNING > INFO)
Patterns like repeated errors often indicate serious problems requiring immediate attention
Automated scripts make log analysis faster and more consistent
Regular log monitoring helps prevent small issues from becoming major outages
